        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-gasterosteus-aculeatus-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-holocene-nonlinear-cellular-wavelength-versus-analytic-k-c-target>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-gasterosteus-aculeatus-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-ks-statistic-patterned-activator-versus-equal-diffusion-control>,
