        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-gasterosteus-aculeatus-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-mask-melanin-area-fraction-versus-rendered-composite>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-gasterosteus-aculeatus-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-versus-render-luminance-ks-inside-the-body-mask>,
